Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:06.32,title,,0,0,0,,美味还是难吃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:07.74,green,,0,0,0,,莉雪大人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:09.32,green,,0,0,0,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:10.28,green,,0,0,0,,米歇尔怎样都
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:11.95,green,,0,0,0,,希望你确认一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.95,0:00:14.24,lightpurple,,0,0,0,,莉雪为凯尔制作的药
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:16.45,lightpurple,,0,0,0,,我也尝试着制作了一份
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:17.49,lightpurple,,0,0,0,,要试试吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.49,0:00:18.12,pink,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:21.59,pink,,0,0,0,,恕我僭越 我来尝一尝吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:24.84,pink,,0,0,0,,奇怪…?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.13,0:00:26.59,green,,0,0,0,,莉雪大人?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:29.51,pink,,0,0,0,,比我做的药更易入口…！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.51,0:00:30.76,lightpurple,,0,0,0,,怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:33.18,lightpurple,,0,0,0,,那看来是失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:34.68,lightpurple,,0,0,0,,药效应该
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:37.22,lightpurple,,0,0,0,,在苦味成分上吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:39.52,lightpurple,,0,0,0,,果然 外行人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:40.31,lightpurple,,0,0,0,,靠着一点小聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:43.56,lightpurple,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,950)}去调药是行不通的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.11,0:00:46.90,pink,,0,0,0,,{\fad(330,0)}也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:48.65,pink,,0,0,0,,我做出来的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:51.78,pink,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,740)}味道是很重的 连药味也是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.95,0:00:54.74,pink,,0,0,0,,但您却说我的汤
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:56.45,pink,,0,0,0,,很美味什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:58.12,pink,,0,0,0,,想必阿诺德殿下您
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:01:00.50,pink,,0,0,0,,有味觉障碍吧…？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.66,0:01:00.50,blue,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.29,blue,,0,0,0,,别一本正经地说这种不光彩的话了
